  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.16 Eligible entity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.16 “Eligible entity” means an entity that has been determined by the department in accordance with this chapter to be eligible for financial assistance under RSA 485-H.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
